# cfctx — never commit secrets or local context state
#
# The real storage for contexts is $CFCTX_ROOT (default ~/.cf-homes/),
# which lives OUTSIDE this repo. These rules are belt-and-suspenders in
# case a user points CFCTX_ROOT into the repo, drops a test env file in,
# or accidentally copies a context for debugging.

# ---- Secrets and per-user env files ----
*.env
!*.env.example
context.env
.cf-homes/
.cfctx/
**/.cf/
**/*.secret
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*_rsa
**/*_ed25519
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*

# ---- Tools and editors ----
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---- Shell/test artifacts ----
*.log
tmp/
tests/bats/
tests/.bats-tmp/
/files.zip
/cfctx-spec.md
